# Probe suite manifest (ADR 0018) — the single registration source.
# Format: lane|name|script|marker
#   default  — deterministic probes run by every full suite run
#   scenario — deterministic EncounterProbeScenario tapes, also run by default
#   manual   — needs a real window (screenshot/visual capture); skipped headlessly
#   tool     — report/artifact generators invoked by their own entrypoints
# Both runner adapters (run_probes.sh, run_probes.ps1) read this file and
# require each probe's declared marker in its output. The suite_manifest probe
# keeps this file complete: every executable probe script must appear here.
default|suite_manifest|res://scripts/debug/suite_manifest_probe.gd|SUITE_MANIFEST_PROBE_OK
default|content|res://scripts/debug/content_validation_probe.gd|CONTENT_VALIDATION_OK
default|rules|res://scripts/debug/sdk_encounter_harness.gd|SDK_ENCOUNTER_HARNESS_OK
default|legality|res://scripts/debug/legality_probe.gd|LEGALITY_PROBE_OK
default|engine_seam|res://scripts/debug/engine_seam_probe.gd|ENGINE_SEAM_PROBE_OK
default|action_stream|res://scripts/debug/action_stream_probe.gd|ACTION_STREAM_PROBE_OK
